   "kind": "Email",
   "draft": "Subject: Transform Swiftline's Payroll in Minutes\n\nDear Ngozi,\n\nI hope you're having a productive week! I recently came across your LinkedIn post mentioning that Swiftline Haulage's payroll still runs on Excel. With 120 dedicated staff members, I can only imagine how time-consuming and error-prone that process must be.\n\nPaysheet is a modern, all-in-one payroll solution designed specifically for Nigerian SMEs. We automatically calculate PAYE and pension deductions, seamlessly pay salaries to any Nigerian bank, and keep your data secure in AWS Cape Town with full NDPR compliance.\n\nSay goodbye to spreadsheets and hello to stress-free payday!\n\nWould you be open to a quick 15-minute demo?\n\nKind regards,\nTunde Bakare\nCo-founder, Paysheet",
